Kubernetes CLI Configuration and Visibility
GitHub Repository Documentation
A lightweight Python command-line tool for inspecting local Kubernetes YAML and JSON manifests. It identifies Pods and
Namespaces, extracts container CPU and memory requests and limits, and displays the results in a structured terminal
table.
The tool clearly distinguishes between missing resource values and explicitly declared zero values, and reports parsing
errors without requiring a live Kubernetes cluster.
